<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Albany Int'l raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Albany Int'l raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Harriet Baldwin upgraded Albany International Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- cited &quot;increased visibility&quot; of company's earnings going forward.</p>
<p>-- raised fiscal 1997 earnings per share estimate to $1.80 from $1.70 and raised fiscal 1998 view to $2.05 from $1.95.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/8 to 23-5/8.</p>
</text>
